Changes in v3.0 2026-11-26:
– The stored contents are saved in linked property lists (l3prop)
  instead of seq variables: storing and getting them by their index
  takes the same time with few or many stored contents. With 1000
  stored contents, \getstored is about 25 to 150 times faster and
  storing environments about 5 to 7 times faster than in v2.9.
– The body of the environments is read in one step.
– Spaces and TAB at the beginning and the end of the body of the
  environments are kept, as in \Scontents*.
– The spaces of \Scontents* are stored with catcode 12.
– The debug-var key is false by default.
– New expand key to store the content expanded.
– New verb-env key; verbatimsc is defined at the beginning of the
  document and only if it does not exist.
– \foreachsc and the remember key work in linear time.
– Fix force-eol and avoid the overload warning in ConTeXt LMTX.
